Criterion 1 interacts with tool/strip_sample_features.dart: routes_registry.dart
now imports the tasks and feature-flags route modules, so both partial variants
need their own golden copy of it. All three variants were applied to throwaway
copies of this tree and analyzed + tested, the same sequence
.github/workflows/strip-smoke.yml runs.

Reproduce with:
  dart run tool/strip_sample_features.dart --apply [--remove-tasks|--remove-feature-flags]
  flutter pub get && flutter analyze && flutter test --timeout=5m


